NextBSD: link libexslt against libm.

libexslt's math module calls fmod, floor, pow, sin and friends, but
1.1.35's CMakeLists.txt only links libm into libxslt. Darwin's libSystem
carries libm, so Apple's build never noticed; on NextBSD libexslt.so.0
needs its own DT_NEEDED on libm, or anything linked with
--no-allow-shlib-undefined (xsltproc) fails. The autotools build has always
linked it ($(LIBM)).

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -322,6 +322,10 @@
 endif()
 
 target_link_libraries(LibExslt PUBLIC LibXslt LibXml2::LibXml2)
+
+if(UNIX)
+	target_link_libraries(LibExslt PRIVATE m)
+endif()
 
 set_target_properties(
 	LibExslt
